	(descr "PLACEHOLDER land pattern for Rakon RPT1490LN TCXO, 14.5 x 9.5 x 6.0 mm. From Rakon datasheet Issue B (21 Oct 2024) page 2 \"Recommended pad layout (top view)\": six 1.2 x 1.8 mm pads, 2.54 mm pitch, pins 1-2-3 on one row and 6-5-4 opposite, row dimension 7.9 mm. The 7.9 mm is ASSUMED to be pad-centre to pad-centre; the bottom view also shows a 6.3 mm dimension that could instead be the inner gap (which would make centres 8.1 mm). Body outline from the 14.5 x 9.5 mm top view. Pin 1 = Vc, 2/3 = GND, 4 = RF out, 5 = DNC, 6 = Vcc. Verify against Rakon drawing (or a Rakon-supplied footprint) before fab.")
